# Build artifacts. Sources of truth:
#   main.wasm     — ./gameplayer, built by tasks.toml's wasm task
#   wasm_exec.js  — $(go env GOROOT)/lib/wasm/wasm_exec.js (copied)
#   style.css     — css/style.css through postcss (build-css task)
#   *.gz, *.br    — not produced here; the host compresses on the wire
#
# They are absent from a fresh checkout, and the embed below is a
# directory embed so the module still builds without them — a server
# started without running `run generate` first serves a page whose
# stylesheet and player are missing, rather than failing to compile.
main.wasm
wasm_exec.js
style.css
*.gz
*.br
